  MED-13/14/15 Apex + LWC, SLA + claims CMDT, flows, QA, email service,
  pages/layouts/paths, Bank Account (lookup to MR), reports + dashboard
  on Medical Request, MED-04 perm set, Medical Team Bupa app, sharing.

  Not included (legacy Request__c / not this object):
  Medical folder reports (Claims, Pre-authorization), Medical Team Dashboard,
  Medical Team Activity dashboard, DomesticMedicalRequestService, EDSMedicalRequest.
